; 1_mml_example_b — action stage loop (A minor, driving)

T150
@p2
@b1
@f4
V13
O5
L8

; melody A — minor riff
A > C E < A  G E C < G
A > C E G  A4 R4

; melody B — push up
> C E G > C  < B G E < B
> D F A > D  < C A F < C

; melody C — descend
> E < A > C E  D < A > C D
< E > C < A E  A4 R4

; bridge — staccato
L16
A R A R > C R E R  < G R G R > B R D R
< F R F R > A R C R  < E R E R > G R B R

~
